 learned a lot and got some great advice from professionals in the music industry. It was inspiring!\n[S3T5] (dia_id: D3:5)\n\nDave: Wow, Calvin! Bet that was inspiring being surrounded by professionals. Did you get any advice from them?\n[S3T6] (dia_id: D3:6)\n\nCalvin: The producer gave me some advice to stay true to myself and sound unique. It got me thinking about where I want my music to go. It's really motivating!\n[S3T7] (dia_id: D3:7)\n\nDave: Wow, Calvin! It's really motivating to see you staying true to yourself. It got me thinking, where do you see your music taking you?\n[S3T8] (dia_id: D3:8)","text_sha256":"0fa64c8a4bb126232fa6b0dc9630ef39dd08884d15580de5e800496e3e146643","timestamp":"2023-04-20T16:15:00"}],"integrity":{"post_tree_sha256":"e9b96bcd4e036f4ea4599edb06e9c0527c929442b09efe05d09ea416b8a4469d","pre_tree_sha256":"e9b96bcd4e036f4ea4599edb06e9c0527c929442b09efe05d09ea416b8a4469d","store_unchanged":true,"verified":true},"metrics":{"completion_tokens":1464,"filesystem_tool_calls":0,"model_calls":4,"orchestration_calls":4,"prompt_tokens":14765,"provider_request_attempts":4,"provider_rounds":4,"token_usage_available":true,"total_tokens":16229},"model":{"requested_model":"coding","served_models":["qwen3.8:27b"]},"prompt_contract":{"derived_prompt_sha256":"6930d93099ac20b76e881b68cbb63b46e1a0a3e2ff43453db685551c3339a6dc","filesystem_tools_sha256":"98017e74a12c2eec4f0139c484d2d6bd809e4f37a8f96c7f419dc9591563dbfa","orchestration_actions_sha256":"3fa6b1160c2f7f9b2a8b3e232721d4ca78a161abb31af0d4f1f2e307b7354581","paper_prompt_id":"refind-appendix-a-stage1-plus-temporal-normalized-v1","paper_prompt_sha256":"20422063cc471ee1de75c38e4250e1a141a731ea2970786a6c715dc3c83cf7de"},"protocol_version":"shared-evidence-bundle-v1","question":{"conversation_id":"conv-50","question":"Where did Calvin attend a music festival in April 2023?","question_id":"conv-50-q074","question_set_id":"locomo-conv50-extension20-v2","run_position":13,"schema_version":1},"question_sha256